  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! Indonesia-Palm Oil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to achieve the outcomes and impacts on palm oil sustainability governance, traceability model which serves smallholders, businesses and consumers, enhanced capacity of CSOs in influencing policy, greater inclusivity of smallholders in the sustainable palm oil sector (certification), which are: 
Strengthened governance of ISPO 
Uptake of smallholders? inclusive sustainable palm oil certification
Enhanced advocacy capacity of CSOs to influence decision making
Strengthened social criteria of sustainability standards (IPOS, ISPO, CPOS) around workers? rights and gender</narrative>
  </description>
